if(B.d.n(s,"approach")||B.d.n(s,"ladki")||B.d.n(s,"direct")||B.d.n(s,"msg")||B.d.n(s,"message")||B.d.n(s,"dm")||B.d.n(s,"cheap")||B.d.n(s,"baat")||B.d.n(s,"start"))return'Jab aap kisi ko direct approach ya message karein, to sabse ahem cheez hai "respectful curiosity":\n\n1. Generic "Hi/Hello" ya cheesy pickup lines se bachiye. Unke bio ya kisi calm photo ki real detail par baat shuru kijiye.\n2. Ek open-ended sawaal poochiye\u2014jaise "Maine dekha aapko books/music pasand hai, aaj kal kya sun/padh rahe hain?"\n3. Unke comfort aur space ka samman kijiye. Intentional connection me tezi ke bajaye authenticity sabse aage aati hai.'
if(B.d.n(s,"date")||B.d.n(s,"nervous")||B.d.n(s,"milna")||B.d.n(s,"darr"))return'Pehli date ya mulaqat par nervousness aana bilkul swabhavik hai.\n\n1. Khud ko "impress" karne ke dabav se azaad rakhiye\u2014sirf ye dekhne jaiye ki kya aap dono ka wavelength milta hai.\n2. Ek calm aur shaant jagah chuniye jahan aap bina shor ke aaram se baith sakein.\n3. Ek gehri saans lijiye; aap jaisa natural aur genuine rahenge, connection utna hi khoobsurat hoga.'
if(B.d.n(s,"bio")||B.d.n(s,"profile")||B.d.n(s,"photo")||B.d.n(s,"pic"))return"Aapka profile aapka digital aaina hai:\n\n1. Apne real shauq aur quiet rituals ka zikr kijiye (jaise morning tea, photography, travel).\n2. Natural aur warm smile wali bina filter ki photos use kijiye.\n3. Jo aap sach me hain wahi likhiye\u2014sachha pan unhi ko attract karega jo aapke liye right match hain."
if(B.d.n(s,"ticket")||B.d.n(s,"report")||B.d.n(s,"grievance")||B.d.n(s,"complaint")||B.d.n(s,"shikayat"))return"Aapne jo complaint ya grievance file ki hai, wo India ke IT Rules 2021 (Rule 3(2)) ke tahat hamare Grievance Officer (ANUBHAV SINGH) ke paas securely submit ho chuki hai.\n\n1. Initial acknowledgment 24 ghante ke andar confirm ho jati hai.\n2. Statutory review and resolution timeline 24 se 48 ghante hai.\n3. Review ke doran reported account isolated rehta hai taaki aapki safety 100% surakshit rahe."
if(B.d.n(s,"kami")||B.d.n(s,"problem")||B.d.n(s,"feedback")||B.d.n(s,"defect")||B.d.n(s,"flaw")||B.d.n(s,"kmi"))return"Aapke feedback aur is kami ko highlight karne ke liye shukriya.\n\nMaine aapka suggestion Asiverticals core engineering team ke liye record kar liya hai. UR-Heart ka uddeshya ek pure aur seamless sanctuary experience dena hai, aur aapka feedback aane wale update me implement kiya jayega."
if(B.d.n(s,"hi")||B.d.n(s,"hello")||B.d.n(s,"namaste")||B.d.n(s,"suno"))return"Namaste! Main Eva hoon, aapki mindful dating companion from Asiverticals.\n\nAap mujhse kisi match ko message karne ka tareeka, pehli date ki preparation, ticket/report status, ya app features ke baare me pooch sakte hain. Aaj main aapki kis tarah madad kar sakti hoon?"
